OL,3,GNEWSAMan fundraises for drones for
OL,4,ANepal flood victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FA paramedic is raising money for
OL,7,Femergency drone technology to help
OL,8,Ffriends in a Nepalese village in the
OL,9,Fwake of devastating flash floods.
OL,11,FMore than 1,000 people have now died in
OL,12,Fthe Himalayan country since the
OL,13,Fdisaster was first reported on 26
OL,14,FAugust, with more than 3,900 missing.
OL,16,FPhil Llewellyn, from Worcester, said
OL,17,Fthe drones would help to find survivors
OL,18,Fand distribute supplies, and funds
OL,19,Fcould also be used to train people how
OL,20,Fto use them.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
