OL,3,GNEWSAMan fundraises for drones for
OL,4,ANepal flood victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe equipment will be used in Kaule,
OL,7,Fwhich Llewellyn said was structurally
OL,8,Funharmed by the flood, but where 15
OL,9,Fresidents have died and forty remain
OL,10,Fmissing after they were swept up while
OL,11,Fworking in an adjacent valley in the
OL,12,Fdistrict of Rasuwa.
